flowchart TB
    SourceCut["Source snapshot and watermarks"]
    Baseline["Baseline profile and control totals"]
    RawChecks["Delivery checks: count, checksum, offsets"]
    StructureChecks["Schema, type and format checks"]
    SemanticChecks["Business rules and RDM mapping"]
    IntegrityChecks["Uniqueness, relationships and temporal checks"]
    DomainChecks["MDM, financial, consent and security checks"]
    AnalyticsChecks["KPI, distributions and business acceptance"]
    Decision{"Validation result"}
    Pass["Pass: allow certification or cutover"]
    Conditional["Conditional Pass: owner, SLA and limitation"]
    Quarantine["Fail: quarantine and publication block"]
    Steward["Data Steward triage"]
    Producer["Producer fixes root cause"]
    Replay["Controlled replay with the same rule version"]
    Evidence["DataHub evidence and audit"]

    SourceCut --> Baseline
    Baseline --> RawChecks
    RawChecks --> StructureChecks
    StructureChecks --> SemanticChecks
    SemanticChecks --> IntegrityChecks
    IntegrityChecks --> DomainChecks
    DomainChecks --> AnalyticsChecks
    AnalyticsChecks --> Decision

    Decision -->|"Pass"| Pass
    Decision -->|"Conditional Pass"| Conditional
    Decision -->|"Fail"| Quarantine

    Quarantine --> Steward
    Steward --> Producer
    Producer --> Replay
    Replay --> StructureChecks

    Pass --> Evidence
    Conditional --> Evidence
    Quarantine --> Evidence
